flowchart TB
  TX[Transaction Management]
  TX --> DECL[Declarative with Transactional]
  DECL --> PROP[Propagation]
  PROP --> REQ[REQUIRED]
  PROP --> SUPP[SUPPORTS]
  PROP --> MAND[MANDATORY]
  PROP --> REQNEW[REQUIRES_NEW]
  PROP --> NOTS[NOT_SUPPORTED]
  PROP --> NEVER[NEVER]
  PROP --> NEST[NESTED]
  DECL --> ISO[Isolation Levels]
  ISO --> DR[READ_UNCOMMITTED]
  ISO --> RC[READ_COMMITTED]
  ISO --> RR[REPEATABLE_READ]
  ISO --> SER[SERIALIZABLE]
  DECL --> RW[Read-Only / Timeout]
  DECL --> ROLL[Rollback Rules]
  ROLL --> RF[rollbackFor]
  ROLL --> NRF[noRollbackFor]

  TX --> PROG[Programmatic]
  PROG --> TT[TransactionTemplate]
  PROG --> PTM[PlatformTransactionManager]

  TX --> EVENTS[Transaction Events]
  EVENTS --> TEL[TransactionalEventListener]
  EVENTS --> PHASE[AFTER_COMMIT / AFTER_ROLLBACK]
  EVENTS --> TSM[TransactionSynchronization]

  TX --> DIST[Distributed Transactions]
  DIST --> JTA[JTA / Atomikos]
  DIST --> TPC[Two-Phase Commit]

  TX --> SAGA[Saga Pattern]
  SAGA --> CHOR[Choreography]
  CHOR --> CE[Compensating Events]
  SAGA --> ORCH[Orchestration]
  ORCH --> STA[State Machine Coordinator]

  TX --> LOCK[Locking]
  LOCK --> OPT[Optimistic / Version]
  LOCK --> PES[Pessimistic / Lock]
